  "worked_solution": "First, we find the matrix $\\,C-\\lambda I:$\n\ufeff\ufeff\ufeff\n\n$$\nC-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}4-\\lambda  & 3 & -6 \\\\ 4 & 5-\\lambda  & -12 \\\\ 3 & 3 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe characteristic equation is $det(C-\\lambda I)=0.$ \n\nExpanding the determinant across the $1$st row, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}4-\\lambda  & 3 & -6 \\\\ 4 & 5-\\lambda  & -12 \\\\ 3 & 3 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (4-\\lambda )|\\begin{aligned}5-\\lambda  & -12 \\\\ 3 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}|-3|\\begin{aligned}4 & -12 \\\\ 3 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}|+(-6)|\\begin{aligned}4 & 5-\\lambda  \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (4-\\lambda )({\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda +1)-3(-4\\lambda +8)-6(-3+3\\lambda ) & =0 \\\\ (-{\\lambda }^{3}+2{\\lambda }^{2}+7\\lambda +4)-(-12\\lambda +24)-(-18+18\\lambda ) & =0 \\\\ -{\\lambda }^{3}+2{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -2 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{3}-2{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda +2 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
